                                "sense_id": "2f00b8fd-8fb1-32a5-8fa2-fe97c563548e",
                                "text": "In his keynote, John Paul Hudson condemned the \"glossy commercialism\" of David Goodstein and the Advocate, which he said was part of a gay media \"backlash\" -- while the anti-gay \"frontlash\" against gays continues."
                            },
                            {
