                                "sense_id": "2f00b8fd-8fb1-32a5-8fa2-fe97c563548e",
                                "text": "When a president uses expansive powers and his policy works, he may benefit from a frontlash effect: the successful assertion of power will not only yield political dividends, it will also strengthen the office of the presidency itself."
                            }
                        ]
